    "silhouette": "Free 2 x 2 spawn surface inside the spawn structure's U: sunken dark armour floor plates burst open by an irregular pool of black-violet brood ooze, broken plates tipped up around it and a clutch of eggs at one edge.",
    "colors": "Darker continuation of the building's near-black armour; black-violet ooze with a wet sheen; a faint deep-violet depth glow only. No frame or light strips: those mark the walls.",
    "anatomy": "Strict orthographic plan view at ground level, no baked shadow. 1 BU = one 32 px cell, pivot = pit centre shared with spawn-structure; canvas 2.25 x 2.25 cells. States sealed/active/dry; a runtime shader animates swells and the splash."
  },
